### HiBank Core API - HTTP Client Test Collection
### Gunakan dengan ekstensi REST Client (VS Code / Cursor) atau JetBrains HTTP Client.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Liveness Probe (Cek apakah aplikasi hidup)
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Readiness Probe (Cek koneksi database PostgreSQL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. V1 Ping (Cek routing API v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/ping
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Sprint 1 - Register User Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Ihsan Pratama",
  "email": "ihsan@hibank.com",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "password": "SuperSecretPassword123!"
}

###

### 5. Sprint 1 - Login
# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@hibank.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "device_id": "iphone-15-pro-max"
}

###

### Simpan session token dari login untuk request selanjutnya
@sessionToken = {{loginRequest.response.body.session_token}}

### 6. Touch / Extend Session (Sliding Inactivity Window)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "session_token": "{{sessionToken}}"
}

###

### 7. Logout (Immediate Revocation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/logout
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

###

### 8. Custom Request ID Header Tracing Test
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json
X-Request-Id: manual-test-trace-id-12345
